{"sha": "ecaffcee8aae820b42037f0b1c1465c27df8d830a092d3a1b7a52ad6fedd73a0", "body": ["\\begin{example}[等效电阻]\\label{ex:g11:circuits-and-power:networks}", "$R_1 = \\qty{100}{\\ohm}$ 与 $R_2 = \\qty{150}{\\ohm}$：串联时为", "\\qty{250}{\\ohm}；并联时为 $\\frac{100 \\times 150}{250} =", "\\qty{60}{\\ohm}$ --- 小于其中任一电阻：电流多了一条通路。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{电路中的能量与功率}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[电功率]\\label{prop:g11:circuits-and-power:power}", "\\index{电功率}", "两端电压为 $U$、通过电流为 $I$ 的用电器，", "以如下速率获得能量：", "\\[ P = U\\,I , \\qquad\\text{即}\\quad E = U\\,I\\,t \\ \\text{在时间 } t . \\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在时间 $t$ 内，电荷 $q = It$ 通过该用电器", "（见\\cref{def:g11:circuits-and-power:current}），每库仑电荷交出", "$U$ 焦耳（见\\cref{def:g11:circuits-and-power:voltage}）：$E = qU = UIt$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[电阻的功率]\\label{prop:g11:circuits-and-power:ri2}", "电阻 $R$ 通过电流 $I$ 时耗散功率", "\\[ P = R\\,I^2 = \\frac{U^2}{R} . \\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将欧姆定律代入 $P = UI$：$P = (RI)I = RI^2 = U(U/R) = U^2/R$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[读取铭牌]\\label{ex:g11:circuits-and-power:nameplate}", "一只标有“\\qty{230}{V} -- \\qty{2200}{W}”的电水壶，其电流为 $I = P/U =", "2200/230 = \\qty{9.6}{A}$，电阻为 $R = U^2/P = 230^2/2200 =", "\\qty{24}{\\ohm}$。工作 \\qty{150}{s} 时消耗 $E = 2200 \\times 150 =", "\\qty{3.3e5}{J} \\approx \\qty{0.09}{kW.h}$ --- 约合两角钱。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[焦耳与千瓦时]\\label{rem:g11:circuits-and-power:kwh}", "电表计量的是千瓦时（见\\cref{def:g10:energy-conservation:kwh}）：", "$\\qty{1}{kW.h} = \\qty{3.6e6}{J}$。焦耳是物理学家使用的单位；", "千瓦时则用于电费结算。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1.5cm, y=0.42cm]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,0) -- (4.6,0) node[right] {$P$};", "  \\foreach \\x/\\t in {1/\\qty{10}{W}, 2/\\qty{100}{W}, 3/\\qty{1}{kW}, 4/\\qty{10}{kW}}", "    {\\draw (\\x,-0.3) -- (\\x,0.3); \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (\\x,-0.35) {\\t};}", "  \\fill[omDef!70] (0,1) rectangle (1.0,1.75);", "  \\node[right] at (1.05,1.4) {LED 灯（\\qty{10}{W}）};", "  \\fill[omDef!70] (0,2.35) rectangle (1.78,3.1);", "  \\node[right] at (1.83,2.75) {笔记本电脑（\\qty{60}{W}）};", "  \\fill[omThm!70] (0,3.7) rectangle (2.95,4.45);", "  \\node[right] at (3.0,4.1) {烤面包机（\\qty{900}{W}）};", "  \\fill[omThm!70] (0,5.05) rectangle (3.34,5.8);", "  \\node[right] at (3.39,5.45) {电水壶（\\qty{2.2}{kW}）};", "  \\fill[omThm!70] (0,6.4) rectangle (3.95,7.15);", "  \\node[right] at (4.0,6.8) {电热淋浴器（\\qty{9}{kW}）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 各类电器的功率（对数坐标轴）：所有发热的电器", "（红色）比所有计算或发光的电器", "（蓝色）高出一个数量级。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{焦耳效应：从烤面包机到输电塔}", "", "\\begin{definition}[焦耳效应]\\label{def:g11:circuits-and-power:joule}", "每个电阻中将电能转化为热能的耗散功率 $P = RI^2$，", "称为\\emph{焦耳效应}\\index{焦耳效应}。电暖器、", "电水壶、烤面包机以及老式灯泡，按设计都是电阻；一个", "\\emph{保险丝}\\index{保险丝}是一根细导线，经标定在电流超过额定值时熔断 ---", "从而断开电路。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[为什么输电要用高压]\\label{ex:g11:circuits-and-power:transmission}", "某村庄需要 $P = \\qty{100}{kW}$ 的功率，经电阻为", "$R_\\ell = \\qty{5.0}{\\ohm}$ 的线路输送。以 $U = \\qty{500}{V}$ 输送时：$I = P/U =", "\\qty{200}{A}$，线路损耗为 $R_\\ell I^2 = \\qty{200}{kW}$ --- 恰为", "输送功率的两倍：荒谬。若以 $U = \\qty{20}{kV}$ 输送，则 $I = \\qty{5.0}{A}$，", "$R_\\ell I^2 = \\qty{125}{W}$。电流减小为原来的四十分之一，损耗则减小为原来的", "$1600$ 分之一。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{circuitikz}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,0) to[sV, l=plant] (0,2)", "        to[R, l_=$R_\\ell$, i=$I$] (3.4,2) -- (4.8,2)", "        to[lamp, l=village] (4.8,0) -- (0,0);", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omThm] at (1.7,2.75) {损耗 $R_\\ell I^2$};", "\\end{circuitikz}", "", "{\\small \\cref{ex:g11:circuits-and-power:transmission} 的输电过程：", "提高 $U$（$P = UI$ 固定）时，$I$ 随之减小，损耗随 $I^2$ 下降。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[电网的铁律]\\label{rem:g11:circuits-and-power:grid}", "在输送功率 $P = UI$ 固定时，线路损耗 $R_\\ell I^2 = R_\\ell", "P^2/U^2$，随输电电压的\\emph{平方}增大而减小。因此：", "升压（\\qty{400}{kV}）以便远送，降压（\\qty{230}{V}）供日常使用。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{remark}[家庭用电安全]\\label{rem:g11:circuits-and-power:safety}", "一条标称 \\qty{230}{V}、配有 \\qty{16}{A} 保险丝的线路，最多提供 $230 \\times 16", "\\approx \\qty{3.7}{kW}$ 的功率：两只电水壶同时工作便会熔断保险丝 --- 这是有意设计的", "最薄弱环节，远比墙内起火便宜得多。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{真实电池：电动势}", ""]}